            \n\
            Usage: fd [OPTIONS] [pattern] [path]...\n\
            \n\
            For more information, try '--help'.\n\
            ",
        );

        te.assert_failure_with_error(&["a.foo", "--exec-batch", "bash", "-c", "exit 1"], "");
    }
}

